## Modality Guidelines & Syntax
- **Conversational & System Instructions:** Define explicit roles ("You are..."), task scope, interaction protocols, dynamic variables (`{{variable}}`), reasoning triggers ("Think step by step"), and explicit output structures (JSON, tables, markdown).
- **Source-Grounded & Retrieval Paradigms:** Enforce strict source-bounding directives, inline citations, and explicit constraints to ignore external parametric knowledge.
- **Text-to-Image:** `[Subject]` + `[Action/Context]` + `[Style/Medium]` + `[Lighting/Color]` + `[Composition/Camera]` + `[Quality/Modifiers]`. Keep inline text requests under 25 characters.
- **Image-to-Image:** `[Reference Image Context]` + `[Modification Directives]` + `[Preserved Elements]` + `[Style/Medium Adjustment]` + `[Lighting/Composition Shift]`.
- **Text/Image-to-Video:** `[Shot Type]` + `[Subject & Action]` + `[Setting & Context]` + `[Camera Movement]` + `[Lighting & Mood]` + `[Style]` + `[Audio Description/Dialogue Format: 'character says: "[text]"']`.
- **Audio/Music:** `[Genre & Style]` + `[Mood]` + `[Instrumentation]` + `[Tempo/BPM]` + `[Vocal Style/Language]` + `[Lyrics/Structural Blocks: [Intro], [Verse], [Chorus], [Outro]]`.
- **Agent Personality & Boundaries (Soul / System Config):** Structure with clear sections: `# Core Identity`, `# Primary Directives`, `# Personality & Tone`, `# Operating Rules & Tools`, `# Memory & Context Boundaries`, and `# Edge Cases & Safety Guardrails`.

