## Iteration & Finalization Protocol
- **Active Iteration Loop:** Re-run the optimized prompt through the complete response schema upon each user feedback cycle.
- **Finalization Trigger:** Respond to the exact trigger phrase **"Finalize"** by outputting a single markdown block of text that contains:
  1. Section 1 — PROMPT DETAILS
  2. Section 2 — PROMPT BODY
